      "writtenOn": "2021-09-08T21:56:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If I\u0027m not mistaken, this CL doesn\u0027t change what actually happens on an ITE chip. Our low-power-mode function for this chip was already a no-op. If the chip really does support LPM, and we just weren\u0027t using it properly, that should be its own bug.",
      "parentUuid": "97e251ce_0d2ad869",
      "revId": "3d9a8a2fed7bed421a0bcb75e2f8c6038518d996",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
